# Files this app keeps its own version of, and why. `new-app.ps1 -Refresh` lists them
# on every run with the reason, so the divergence stays visible, but stops treating
# them as a merge still owed. Anything not listed here still holds .kit-version back.
#
# Both of these exist because the Flutter project is in Hisscore/, not at the repo
# root, which is where the kit assumes it is.
scripts/version.sh        # VERSION_FILE points at Hisscore/pubspec.yaml
.github/dependabot.yml    # directory: /Hisscore, for the same reason
docs/STACK_NOTES.md       # ci.yaml and Hisscore/dist paths, for the same reason
